# Shared Components Directory

This directory contains shared components that are reused across different portfolio layouts (traditional and chat/widget layouts).

## Purpose

- Maximize code reuse between traditional portfolio and chat widgets
- Maintain visual consistency across layouts
- Reduce code duplication and maintenance burden
- Ensure bug fixes and improvements apply to all contexts

## Components

Shared components will be created here as part of the chat widgets UI revamp:

- `ProjectsSection.tsx` - Shared projects display component
- `WorkExperienceSection.tsx` - Shared work experience display component
- Additional shared components as needed

## Usage Pattern

Shared components accept a `variant` prop to adapt their styling and layout for different contexts:

```typescript
<SharedComponent variant="traditional" />  // For traditional portfolio
<SharedComponent variant="widget" />       // For chat widgets
```
